@startuml
title ATM Control - Polished Requirement Specification

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state "Waiting for PIN" as WaitingForPIN
state ValidatingPIN
state "Displaying Options" as DisplayOptions
state ProcessingRequest
state Ejecting
state Confiscating

Idle : entry / Greet User

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt, Try Again
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Third Invalid PIN, Card Stolen, Card Expired / Confiscate, Update Status
ValidatingPIN --> DisplayOptions : Valid PIN / Display Menu

WaitingForPIN --> Ejecting : Cancel / Eject
ValidatingPIN --> Ejecting : Cancel / Eject
DisplayOptions --> Ejecting : Cancel / Eject

DisplayOptions --> ProcessingRequest : Choice Made / Process Request

ProcessingRequest --> Ejecting : Rejected / Eject, Display Apology

Confiscating --> Ejecting : Card Confiscated / Display Confiscated

Ejecting --> Idle : Card Ejected / Display Ejected

@enduml
